## 🎯 WHAT WAS FIXED

### 1. Module System Issues
```javascript
// Before: CommonJS in ES module project
const request = require('supertest');

// After: ES modules throughout
import request from 'supertest';
```

### 2. Export Issues
```javascript
// Before: Default export
export default router;

// After: Named export matching imports
export const authRouter = router;
```

### 3. Test Infrastructure
```javascript
// Before: Importing full server with DB connections
const app = require('../server');

// After: Creating minimal test app
const app = express();
app.use('/api/auth', authRouter);
```

